Subject: [PATCH 2/2] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...ket.Address.IPv4+IP.swift => Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv4.swift} | 0
 ...ket.Address.IPv6+IP.swift => Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv6.swift} | 0
 ...ckets.TCP.Connection+IP.swift => Sockets.TCP.Connection.swift} | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Sockets IP Address/{Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv4+IP.swift => Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv4.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Sockets IP Address/{Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv6+IP.swift => Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv6.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Sockets IP Address/{Sockets.TCP.Connection+IP.swift => Sockets.TCP.Connection.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv4+IP.swift b/Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv4.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv4+IP.swift
rename to Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv4.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv6+IP.swift b/Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv6.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv6+IP.swift
rename to Sources/Sockets IP Address/Kernel.Socket.Address.IPv6.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Sockets IP Address/Sockets.TCP.Connection+IP.swift b/Sources/Sockets IP Address/Sockets.TCP.Connection.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Sockets IP Address/Sockets.TCP.Connection+IP.swift
